<!--
  The three pages that should rank, on the apex host, at their extensionless URLs.

  Extensionless because that is the URL nginx.conf is built to serve (`try_files $uri
  $uri.html`) and the one that goes into emails and supplier questionnaires. Listing
  /terms.html here instead would advertise a second URL for the same page and split
  the signals between them.

  /unsubscribe and /404.html are deliberately absent: one is transactional, the other
  is not a page.
-->
